   "alt": "Diagram in three bands. Top band, labelled The technology: four boxes for hardware (computers, phones, servers, routers), software (operating systems, applications), data, and networks (the Internet, mobile networks, Wi-Fi). A bracket joins them to an arrow pointing down to the middle band, labelled Used to, which lists six actions: capture, store, process, retrieve, transmit and present. A second arrow points down to the bottom band, labelled The purpose: useful information for people and organisations; IT exists to solve information problems, never as technology for its own sake. A final line gives an example: electricity meter readings are recorded and turned into bills.",
