  {
   "screen": "Processing: sorting and calculating",
   "title": "Figure 1.6.3 · Seaside Pharmacy: calculate, then sort",
   "alt": "Horizontal bar chart of sales in US dollars, sorted in descending order, for the Seaside Pharmacy. Sunscreen SPF50: 580.00 dollars from 40 units. Insect repellent: 495.00 dollars from 55 units. Bottled water (case): 360.00 dollars from 30 units. Panadol 24s: 312.00 dollars from 48 units. Total 1,747.00 dollars. The steps shown above the chart are: calculate sales equals units times price for each row, then sort by sales, descending. A note says sunscreen earns the most money although insect repellent sells the most units.",
   "caption": "The raw till roll could not show it: sunscreen earns the most even though insect repellent sells the most units. Always state the sort key and the order.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M1U6-3-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"M1U6-3-k\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"16\" y=\"10\" width=\"286\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"159\" y=\"31.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1  Calculate: sales = units × price</text><line x1=\"302\" y1=\"27\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"27\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U6-3-a)\"/><rect x=\"334\" y=\"10\" width=\"290\" height=\"34\" rx=\"17\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"479\" y=\"31.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2  Sort by sales, descending</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"238\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">US$0</text><line x1=\"283.3\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"283.3\" y2=\"238\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"283.3\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">US$200</text><line x1=\"376.7\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"376.7\" y2=\"238\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"376.7\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">US$400</text><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"238\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">US$600</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">Sunscreen SPF50</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"72\" width=\"270.7\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"468.7\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">580.00  (40 units)</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">Insect repellent</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"114\" width=\"231\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-muted\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"429\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">495.00  (55 units)</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">Bottled water (case)</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"156\" width=\"168\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-muted\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"366\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\">360.00  (30 units)</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">Panadol 24s</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"198\" width=\"145.6\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-muted\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"343.6\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"13\">312.00  (48 units)</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"13\">Most money: sunscreen (US$580). Most units: insect repellent (55). Total US$1,747.00.</text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Feedback: closing the loop",
   "title": "Figure 1.6.4 · Feedback at the Harbour View Supermarket",
   "alt": "A loop of four boxes connected clockwise by arrows. Processing: each sale reduces the stock count. Output: when a count drops below the re-order level, the system prints a re-order list. Evaluation (feedback): the manager checks the list and places orders. Update (feedback, looping to input): deliveries arrive from the cargo port and the new stock is entered. The update arrow returns to processing to complete the cycle. The centre reads: feedback makes it a cycle, not a line; it is optional and loops to input.",
   "caption": "The dashed steps are feedback: they evaluate the output and update the data, so the next cycle starts with current stock figures.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M1U6-4-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"M1U6-4-k\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"240\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">PROCESSING</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">each sale reduces the stock count</text><rect x=\"424\" y=\"128\" width=\"200\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"524\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">OUTPUT</tspan></text><text x=\"524\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"524\">below re-order level:</tspan><tspan x=\"524\" dy=\"16\">re-order list printed</tspan></text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"246\" width=\"240\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">EVALUATION (feedback)</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">manager checks list, places orders</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"128\" width=\"200\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\"/><text x=\"116\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">UPDATE → INPUT</tspan></text><text x=\"116\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"116\">deliveries arrive;</tspan><tspan x=\"116\" dy=\"16\">new stock entered</tspan></text><path d=\"M440,49H524V124\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U6-4-a)\"/><path d=\"M524,204V281H444\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U6-4-a)\"/><path d=\"M200,281H116V208\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U6-4-a)\"/><path d=\"M116,128V49H196\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 4\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U6-4-a)\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Feedback makes it</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">a cycle, not a line.</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">It is optional and</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">loops back to input.</text></svg>"
  }
