   "screen": "Forums, message boards and mailing lists",
   "title": "Figure 1.8.3 · Pull tools and push tools",
   "alt": "Left panel, pull: users must go to the site to read. Arrows run from three users to a website holding a discussion forum, where replies are grouped in threads under topics, and a message board, a simpler list of notices with the newest first. Right panel, push: a sender posts one message to the list address of a mailing list, which delivers a copy to the inbox of every subscriber, shown as three inboxes.",
   "caption": "Forums and message boards are pull tools: members visit the site. A mailing list is a push tool: messages arrive in each member’s inbox.",
