   "alt": "A mock application form titled Student application with numbered callouts. 1, title. 2, field prompt, such as First name. 3, entry marker, the box where the user types. 4, drop-down list, for Programme, set to Information Technology. 5, radio buttons, choose one: Full-time or Part-time. 6, check box: Send me updates. 7, messaging area, showing an error: Date of birth must be DD/MM/YYYY; 31/02/2009 is not a real date. 8, Submit and Clear buttons. Required fields are marked with an asterisk.",
   "caption": "The computer sets out the questions and the user answers them, field by field. Validation and controls such as drop-down lists reduce data-entry errors.",
