  {
   "screen": "Worked case: Carenage Water Taxi",
   "title": "Figure 3.1.3 · The Carenage Water Taxi case, stage by stage",
   "alt": "Six numbered cards in reading order, top row left to right and then bottom row right to left. 1 Define: the paper diary means boats are booked twice; about five cruise groups a week are left waiting at the pier. 2 Analyse: the cause is two staff and one diary; requirements are shared bookings on a phone; limits are a US$1,500 budget and mobile data only. 3 Identify and evaluate: A a shared spreadsheet, B a subscription booking system, C a custom-built app, each with points for and against. 4 Select and justify: B, because it blocks a boat once booked, removing the cause, fits the budget and can be running within a week. 5 Implement: enter boats and timetables, train both staff and switch from the diary on the first of the month. 6 Evaluate and review: after three months, check double bookings against a target of zero, complaints and feedback. A dashed arrow from card 6 back to card 2 is labelled: if problems remain, for example weak signal at the pier, return to analysis.",
   "caption": "Each stage hands something to the next. The review compares results with the figures in the problem statement and can send the team back to analysis.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 356\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M3U1-3-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"M3U1-3-k\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"16\" y=\"14\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"34\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"38.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Define</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"28\">Paper diary: boats booked</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"20\">twice; about five cruise</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"20\">groups a week left</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"20\">waiting at the pier</tspan></text><rect x=\"225\" y=\"14\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"243\" cy=\"34\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"243\" y=\"38.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Analyse</text><text x=\"237\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"237\">Cause: two staff, one</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"19\">diary. Needs: shared</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"19\">bookings on a phone.</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"19\">Limits: US$1,500 and</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"19\">mobile data only</tspan></text><rect x=\"434\" y=\"14\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"452\" cy=\"34\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"452\" y=\"38.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Identify, evaluate</text><text x=\"446\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"446\">A shared spreadsheet</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"20\">B subscription system</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"20\">C custom-built app</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"20\">each with for and against</tspan></text><rect x=\"434\" y=\"198\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"452\" cy=\"218\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"452\" y=\"222.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Select and justify</text><text x=\"446\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"446\">B: blocks a boat once</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"20\">booked, removing the</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"20\">cause; fits the budget;</tspan><tspan x=\"446\" dy=\"20\">running within a week</tspan></text><rect x=\"225\" y=\"198\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"243\" cy=\"218\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"243\" y=\"222.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Implement</text><text x=\"237\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"237\">Enter boats and</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"20\">timetables, train both</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"20\">staff, switch from the</tspan><tspan x=\"237\" dy=\"20\">diary on the 1st</tspan></text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"198\" width=\"190\" height=\"146\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"218\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"222.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">Evaluate and review</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"28\">After three months:</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"20\">double bookings (target</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"20\">zero), complaints and</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"20\">feedback</tspan></text><line x1=\"206\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"223\" y2=\"87\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U1-3-a)\"/><line x1=\"415\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"87\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U1-3-a)\"/><line x1=\"529\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"529\" y2=\"196\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U1-3-a)\"/><line x1=\"434\" y1=\"271\" x2=\"417\" y2=\"271\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U1-3-a)\"/><line x1=\"225\" y1=\"271\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"271\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U1-3-a)\"/><path d=\"M150,198L246,162\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U1-3-a)\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" font-style=\"italic\">problems remain? back to analysis</text></svg>"
  }
