  {
   "screen": "The design specification: logical design, physical design and prototypes",
   "title": "Figure 3.4.3 · Design turns \"what\" into \"how\": Harbour Ferry Line",
   "alt": "Three columns joined by arrows. 1, logical design, what data and processes are needed: three entities, Passenger, Booking and Sailing, with each booking linking one passenger to one sailing; no hardware or software is chosen yet. 2, physical design, the blueprint: a Bookings table with BookingID (the key, six characters), PassengerID, SailingID and FareType fields; platform a cloud-hosted web app; language Java; a decision table for child, senior and resident fares. 3, prototype, customers inspect before development: a clickable booking screen with a Pay button; ticket clerks asked for a larger Pay button before coding began.",
   "caption": "Logical design says what data and processes are needed; physical design says how they will be built on real hardware and software; a prototype lets users find problems before expensive coding.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M3U4-3-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"M3U4-3-k\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"16\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"280\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">1 LOGICAL DESIGN</tspan></text><text x=\"112\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">what is needed</text><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"222\" y2=\"150\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U4-3-a)\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"280\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">2 PHYSICAL DESIGN</tspan></text><text x=\"320\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">the blueprint</text><line x1=\"418\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"150\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U4-3-a)\"/><rect x=\"432\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"280\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"528\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">3 PROTOTYPE</tspan></text><text x=\"528\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">users inspect it</text><rect x=\"48\" y=\"68\" width=\"128\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"87.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Passenger</text><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"126\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M104,138L112,126M112,138V126M120,138L112,126\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"48\" y=\"138\" width=\"128\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"157.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Booking</text><path d=\"M104,168L112,180M112,168V180M120,168L112,180\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"208\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"48\" y=\"208\" width=\"128\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"227.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sailing</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"112\">each booking links one</tspan><tspan x=\"112\" dy=\"16\">passenger to one sailing</tspan></text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"66\" width=\"168\" height=\"128\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"234\" y=\"66\" width=\"168\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-gold\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">Bookings table</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">BookingID (key)</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"13\">PassengerID</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"13\">SailingID</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"13\">FareType</text><text x=\"318\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"318\">BookingID: six characters</tspan><tspan x=\"318\" dy=\"17\">Platform: cloud web app</tspan><tspan x=\"318\" dy=\"17\">Language: Java</tspan><tspan x=\"318\" dy=\"17\">Decision table for fares</tspan></text><rect x=\"456\" y=\"66\" width=\"152\" height=\"170\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"532\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Book a sailing</text><rect x=\"470\" y=\"102\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-softb s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"128\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-softb s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"154\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-softb s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"186\" width=\"124\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-gold s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"532\" y=\"210.3\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-ongold\" font-weight=\"bold\">Pay</text><text x=\"532\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\" font-style=\"italic\"><tspan x=\"532\">clerks: &quot;make the Pay</tspan><tspan x=\"532\" dy=\"16\">button bigger&quot;</tspan></text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"300\" width=\"608\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"322\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Requirements specification says WHAT  →  design specification says HOW</text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Testing: verification, validation and the test report",
   "title": "Figure 3.4.4 · Verification and validation check against different things",
   "alt": "On the left, the system under test: Harbour Gems Jewellers' sales system. Two arrows lead to two checks. Top, verification: are we building the product right? The system is compared with the design specification. Result, with a tick: passes, every total is calculated correctly. Bottom, validation: are we building the right product? The system is compared with the users' real needs. Result, with a cross: fails, staff cannot record layaway payments. A note underneath: a system can pass verification and still fail validation.",
   "caption": "Learn the two questions word for word. Verification checks the system against the specification; validation checks it against what the users really need.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 312\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M3U4-4-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"M3U4-4-k\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0L10,5L0,10z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"16\" y=\"96\" width=\"150\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"91\" y=\"125.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan x=\"91\">Harbour Gems</tspan><tspan x=\"91\" dy=\"17\">Jewellers'</tspan><tspan x=\"91\" dy=\"17\">sales system</tspan></text><path d=\"M166,124H182V66H196\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U4-4-a)\"/><path d=\"M166,152H182V214H196\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U4-4-a)\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"14\" width=\"424\" height=\"112\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">VERIFICATION</tspan></text><text x=\"346\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">&quot;Are we building the product right?&quot;</text><rect x=\"214\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"72.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the system</text><line x1=\"338\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"386\" y2=\"68\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U4-4-a)\" marker-start=\"url(#M3U4-4-a)\"/><rect x=\"390\" y=\"52\" width=\"220\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"72.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the design specification</text><path d=\"M217,104l5,6l10,-12\" class=\"f-none s-ok\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"109\" font-size=\"13\">Passes: every total is calculated correctly</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"152\" width=\"424\" height=\"112\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\"><tspan class=\"f-blue\">VALIDATION</tspan></text><text x=\"346\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">&quot;Are we building the right product?&quot;</text><rect x=\"214\" y=\"190\" width=\"120\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"210.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the system</text><line x1=\"338\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"386\" y2=\"206\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U4-4-a)\" marker-start=\"url(#M3U4-4-a)\"/><rect x=\"390\" y=\"190\" width=\"220\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"210.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the users' real needs</text><path d=\"M218,236l12,12M230,236l-12,12\" class=\"f-none s-bad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"247\" font-size=\"13\">Fails: staff cannot record layaway payments</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"296\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">A system can pass verification and still fail validation.</text></svg>"
  }
